# Build context for docker/Dockerfile.cc-worker only. BuildKit uses this file
# for that Dockerfile; MemoryCore/Dockerfile builds from MemoryCore/ with its
# own ignore file.
# Allow-list: the worker image needs only the entrypoint, so .env, .env.cc,
# node_modules, MemoryCore/ and everything else stay out (the code is cloned
# at run time).
*
!docker/entrypoint.sh
